{
  "episode": "ESSY-0006",
  "language": "zh-TW",
  "sourceLanguage": "en",
  "status": "draft; not human-approved",
  "translations": {
    "What if the ordinary life you've built could disappear overnight?": "如果你建立的平凡生活，一夜之間就消失了呢？",
    "How do you live with the fear of losing everything,": "明明什麼都沒有做錯，卻可能失去一切。",
    "when you've done nothing wrong?": "你該如何帶著這份恐懼生活？",
    "And what does it mean to keep building a life,": "明知道一切仍可能被奪走，",
    "knowing that everything could still be taken away?": "繼續建立生活，又意味著什麼？",
    "We spend much of our lives building things.": "我們花了大半輩子，一點一滴建立生活。",
    "A career. A home.": "一份事業。一個家。",
    "A family. Some savings.": "一個家庭。一些積蓄。",
    "Plans for what we might": "還有為年老之後",
    "do when we are older.": "想做的事所訂下的計畫。",
    "And if we are fortunate,": "如果夠幸運，",
    "little by little,": "日子會一點一滴地",
    "life begins to feel stable.": "安定下來。",
    "For most of my life,": "在我人生的大部分時間裡，",
    "that fear has been": "那份恐懼一直",
    "somewhere in the background.": "隱約存在。",
    "Not always present in my thoughts.": "它並非時時浮現在腦海中。",
    "But never entirely gone.": "卻也從未完全消失。",
    "I grew up in a place where the possibility of war was never entirely abstract.": "我成長的地方，戰爭的可能性從來不是遙不可及的事。",
    "When I was young, there were moments when that possibility suddenly felt very real.": "年輕時，有些時刻，那種可能性突然變得很真實。",
    "I remember being afraid.": "我記得自己很害怕。",
    "I had not yet done": "那時我還沒有",
    "my military service,": "服兵役，",
    "and war meant something": "而戰爭對我來說",
    "very simple to me:": "意味著一件很簡單的事：",
    "What if I have to go?": "如果我必須去呢？",
    "That was about thirty years ago.": "那大約是三十年前的事。",
    "The war never came.": "戰爭最終沒有發生。",
    "I finished my military": "我服完了",
    "service. I worked.": "兵役，也工作了。",
    "I got married.": "我結了婚。",
    "I became a father.": "我當了父親。",
    "Eventually, I got used": "後來，我漸漸習慣了",
    "to living with the possibility.": "帶著這種可能性過日子。",
    "Whenever it felt a little closer,": "每當戰爭似乎又近了一點，",
    "I could only look for reassurance": "我只能從身邊的說法中",
    "in the arguments around me.": "尋找一點安心。",
    "They wouldn't really do it.": "他們不會真的這麼做。",
    "The cost would be too high.": "代價太高了。",
    "It wouldn't make sense.": "那樣不合常理。",
    "Maybe those arguments are right.": "也許那些說法是對的。",
    "I hope they are.": "我希望那些說法是真的。",
    "But either way,": "但無論如何，",
    "I need something": "我需要一些東西，",
    "that lets me put": "讓我能把",
    "the fear aside": "恐懼放在一旁，",
    "and get on with my life.": "繼續過日子。",
    "Because there is not much else I can do.": "因為除此之外，我能做的並不多。",
    "I thought getting older would make me less afraid.": "我以為年紀大了，就不會那麼害怕。",
    "Instead, the fear changed.": "但恐懼只是換了一種模樣。",
    "When I was young,": "年輕的時候，",
    "war threatened a life": "戰爭威脅的是一段",
    "that had barely begun.": "才剛剛開始的人生。",
    "Now it threatens a life": "如今，它威脅的是",
    "that took decades to build.": "花了幾十年才建立起來的生活。",
    "A house can be replaced.": "房子可以換一間。",
    "Money can, at least in theory,": "錢至少在理論上，",
    "be earned again.": "也可以再賺。",
    "A job can be found again.": "工作可以再找。",
    "But the years it took to build": "但建立這一切所花的歲月，",
    "those things are gone forever.": "已經一去不回。",
    "At my age, starting over does": "到了我這個年紀，重新開始",
    "not feel like an adventure.": "並不像一場冒險。",
    "I don't know if I have another thirty": "我不知道自己是否還有三十年，",
    "years to build the same life again.": "能再建立一次同樣的生活。",
    "And then I look at Ukraine.": "然後，我看向烏克蘭。",
    "What I find hardest to imagine is": "我最難想像的，",
    "not only the moment when war begins.": "不只是戰爭開始的那一刻。",
    "It is everything that comes after.": "而是之後發生的一切。",
    "How do you live like that for years?": "那樣的日子，要怎麼過上好幾年？",
    "Children still grow older.": "孩子仍然會長大。",
    "People still need food.": "人們仍然需要食物。",
    "Parents still need care.": "父母仍然需要照顧。",
    "People still work,": "人們仍然要工作，",
    "get sick, celebrate birthdays,": "會生病、慶祝生日，",
    "and wonder what next year will look like.": "也會想著明年會是什麼樣子。",
    "At some point, war is no longer an emergency.": "到了某個時候，戰爭不再是一場緊急事件。",
    "It becomes the condition under which ordinary life has to continue.": "它成了日常生活必須繼續下去的處境。",
    "That is what frightens me.": "這才是讓我害怕的事。",
    "Not only that I might die.": "不只是我可能會死。",
    "That I might live.": "還有我可能會活下來。",
    "And have to figure": "然後必須想辦法",
    "out how to live": "繼續活下去，",
    "after the life": "即使那段",
    "I spent decades": "花了幾十年",
    "building is gone.": "建立的生活已經消失。",
    "Sometimes I wonder what goes through the minds of people who start wars.": "有時我會想，那些發動戰爭的人，心裡究竟在想什麼。",
    "Why isn't it enough to take care of your own country?": "為什麼照顧好自己的國家還不夠？",
    "Why must someone else's home become part of your ambition?": "為什麼別人的家園，非得成為你野心的一部分？",
    "I know there are answers.": "我知道這些問題有答案。",
    "History. Territory. Security.": "歷史、領土、安全。",
    "Power. National interest.": "權力、國家利益。",
    "But none of those words": "但這些詞都無法改變",
    "changes the question I": "那個我始終",
    "keep coming back to:": "反覆追問的問題：",
    "Why should my family pay": "為什麼我的家人要為一個",
    "the price for a decision": "我們毫不相干的決定",
    "we had nothing to do with?": "付出代價？",
    "Maybe that is why I feel so helpless.": "也許這就是我感到如此無力的原因。",
    "There are many things in life I cannot control.": "人生有很多事情不在我的掌控之中。",
    "But usually, I can at least do something.": "但通常，我至少還能做點什麼。",
    "I can work harder.": "我可以更努力工作。",
    "I can save more.": "我可以多存一點錢。",
    "I can prepare.": "我可以做好準備。",
    "But I cannot work hard": "但無論我多麼努力，",
    "enough to make war impossible.": "都無法徹底排除戰爭發生的可能。",
    "Sometimes this fear feels a little like thinking about death.": "有時，這份恐懼有點像想到死亡時的感覺。",
    "Not because war is inevitable. It isn't.": "不是因為戰爭注定會發生。戰爭並非必然。",
    "But both remind me how little": "而是兩者都提醒我，",
    "of the future I truly control.": "我真正能掌控的未來有多麼有限。",
    "There is, however,": "不過，兩者之間",
    "an important difference.": "有一個重要的差別。",
    "Death ends the planning.": "死亡會讓計畫終止。",
    "War may destroy the plan": "戰爭可能摧毀原本的計畫，",
    "and leave you here": "卻讓你留在這裡，",
    "to make another one.": "必須重新做打算。",
    "So what am I supposed to do?": "那麼，我該怎麼辦？",
    "Nothing.": "什麼也做不了。",
    "At least, nothing that can make": "至少，沒有什麼能讓",
    "the possibility go away.": "那種可能性消失。",
    "So I go to work.": "所以我繼續上班。",
    "I take care of my family.": "我照顧家人。",
    "I save money.": "我存錢。",
    "I make plans.": "我做計畫。",
    "I keep building.": "我繼續建立生活。",
    "Not because I have": "不是因為我已經",
    "solved the fear.": "克服了恐懼。",
    "I haven't. Part": "我沒有。我心裡有一部分",
    "of me still wonders": "仍然會想，",
    "whether one day": "這件事會不會有一天",
    "it will happen.": "真的發生。",
    "I just don't know when.": "我只是不知道會是什麼時候。",
    "And if I reach eighty": "如果我活到八十歲，",
    "and it never does?": "而戰爭始終沒有發生呢？",
    "I don't think I will": "我想我不會說，",
    "say I worried for nothing.": "那些擔憂都是白費的。",
    "I think I will say:": "我想我會說：",
    "How fortunate I was.": "我多麼幸運。",
    "I was allowed to have": "我得以擁有",
    "an ordinary life. I worked.": "平凡的一生。我工作。",
    "I raised a family. I grew old.": "我成家育兒。我漸漸老去。",
    "I made plans for tomorrow,": "我為明天做計畫，",
    "and most mornings,": "而大多數時候，",
    "tomorrow arrived looking more": "明天來臨時，",
    "or less like the day before.": "都和前一天差不多。",
    "But even then, there would": "但即使到了那時，",
    "be another question.": "還會有另一個問題。",
    "What about my child?": "我的孩子呢？",
    "And what about his children?": "他的孩子們呢？",
    "If the danger I worried": "如果我年輕時擔憂的危險，",
    "about when I was young is": "到了我年老時",
    "still there when I am old,": "仍然存在，",
    "then perhaps I did not escape the question.": "那麼也許我並沒有躲過這個問題。",
    "I simply lived long enough to see": "我只是活得夠久，",
    "another generation inherit it.": "看見下一代接下了這個問題。",
    "I don't need history to remember": "我不需要歷史記得",
    "my generation as brave.": "我們這一代人有多勇敢。",
    "I don't want to find": "我不想知道",
    "out whether I would be brave.": "自己是否真的有勇氣。",
    "And I don't want my child": "我也不希望我的孩子",
    "to have to find out either.": "必須去弄清楚這件事。",
    "If I am fortunate enough to grow old in peace,": "如果我有幸在和平中老去，",
    "I hope that fortune does not end with me.": "我希望這份幸運不會在我身上終止。",
    "I hope my children can work,": "我希望我的孩子們能工作，",
    "build homes, raise families,": "建立家園、養育孩子，",
    "complain about small things,": "為小事抱怨，",
    "worry about retirement,": "擔心退休，",
    "and make plans for years": "並為還沒到來的日子",
    "that have not arrived yet.": "做打算。",
    "I hope they can take": "我希望他們能把",
    "tomorrow for granted.": "明天視為理所當然。",
    "To make plans.": "可以做計畫。",
    "To build things.": "可以去創造、去累積。",
    "To assume there will": "相信自己會有時間",
    "be time to enjoy them.": "享受這些成果。",
    "Maybe that is all I really want.": "也許這就是我真正想要的一切。",
    "An ordinary life.": "平凡的生活。",
    "Not only for me.": "不只是我能擁有，",
    "For them, too.": "他們也能。"
  }
}
